	(text "Implement GPS to be used as part of the rocket's state estimation solution.\nWe should implement one that is rated for the g forces, is very common, and provides good accuracy.\nIt should also have an external antenna, and we should route it through an SMA connector.\n\nthe MAX-M10S-00B seems like a good option."
